<title>USA: Johnston, Iowa, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Johnston, Iowa, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson Inc., said it won $2.070 million of Johnston, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Sesris 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.21 percent.</p>
</text>
